{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EPH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以弗所書","commonName":"以弗所書","title":"以弗所書","order":49,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"db78a372ea9ca7349277c4e41277189d1fe5c012beeb7e181306765d4f5c7c8a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EPH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EPH/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":154},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["保羅奉差向外邦人傳福音"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["因此，我－保羅為你們外邦人作了基督耶穌被囚的，替你們祈禱",{"noteId":5},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["諒必你們曾聽見上帝賜恩給我，將關切你們的職分託付我，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["用啟示使我知道福音的奧祕，正如我以前略略寫過的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你們念了，就能曉得我深知基督的奧祕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["這奧祕在以前的世代沒有叫人知道，像如今藉着聖靈啟示他的聖使徒和先知一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["這奧祕就是外邦人在基督耶穌裏，藉着福音，得以同為後嗣，同為一體，同蒙應許。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我作了這福音的執事，是照上帝的恩賜，這恩賜是照他運行的大能賜給我的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我本來比眾聖徒中最小的還小，然而他還賜我這恩典，叫我把基督那測不透的豐富傳給外邦人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又使眾人都明白，這歷代以來隱藏在創造萬物之上帝裏的奧祕是如何安排的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["為要藉着教會使天上執政的、掌權的，現在得知上帝百般的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["這是照上帝從萬世以前，在我們主基督耶穌裏所定的旨意。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我們因信耶穌，就在他裏面放膽無懼，篤信不疑地來到上帝面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所以，我求你們不要因我為你們所受的患難喪膽，這原是你們的榮耀。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["明白基督的愛"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因此，我在父面前屈膝，（"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["天上地上的各",{"noteId":6},"家，都是從他得名。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["求他按着他豐盛的榮耀，藉着他的靈，叫你們心裏的力量剛強起來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["使基督因你們的信，住在你們心裏，叫你們的愛心有根有基，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["能以和眾聖徒一同明白基督的愛是何等長闊高深，"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["並知道這愛是過於人所能測度的，便叫上帝一切所充滿的，充滿了你們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["上帝能照着運行在我們心裏的大力充充足足地成就一切，超過我們所求所想的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["但願他在教會中，並在基督耶穌裏，得着榮耀，直到世世代代，永永遠遠。阿們！"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"此句是照對十四節所加","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":1}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：全","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EPH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EPH/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EPH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}